<title>SRI LANKA: Weather-Inland rains seen in Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather-Inland rains seen in Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's meteorological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Monday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Canyon		   13.8</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	    20.0</p>
<p>    Kotmale		  22.7</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  6.8</p>
<p>    Moussakele	     23.9</p>
<p>    Norton		    3.0</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     5.3</p>
<p>    Victoria		 24.0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    5.0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		  25.2</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  0.0</p>
<p>The department forecasts isolated afternoon or evening thundershowers inland, which it says will spread to the west coast later.</p>
</text>
